ARTOMETRICS GLOSSARY — PLACEHOLDER STUB
This is not a binary Adobe Photoshop file.
It is a text brief saved as .psd so an agent can find it next to the HTML starter.
Do not expect Photoshop to open it as vectors or layers.

Style: Pop Art
Board: /styles/pop-art
Companions: pop-art-starter.html, pop-art-study.ai, pop-art-study.psd

Document
3000 × 1200 px, 300 ppi. Ground #f7f4ee.

Layer stack, top to bottom
- Black outlines, 8 px, hard
- Product flats: blue #0047ab, yellow #f5c400
- Dot pattern, red #e31c23, regular grid, behind the product
- Ground

Rules
Hard edges. No airbrush. The dot layer is a pattern, not a scanned comic.
No celebrity, no logo, no soup can.
